In retrospect, I did recall seeing very few employees\nduring my visits today, and only on a handful of occasions\ndid I talk to the actual person in charge.%K%P
话说回来，在我出去办事的地方，有的是谁都没来，\n有的只有一个非负责人的职工上班，\n经常碰到事情没什么进展的状况。%K%P
