I glanced at the clock after I finally filled out the\nstatements of delivery, the purchase orders, and got the\nnumber of remaining apology emails down to a mere two.%K%P
搞定了采购单和发票，\n又发完两份道歉信之后，\n久违地看了一眼手表。%K%P
I've already got drafts of the proposals prepared, so all\nI had to do was type them out in the word processor.%K%P
拟议的文件只需要打打草稿就行，\n之后就用打字机打一份…%K%P
