I could feel exhaustion weighing down on me; a lengthy\nperiod of unemployment had left me completely out of\nshape.%K%P
到底是有过一段没高强度工作的空白期，\n才这种程度我就感觉有些累得够呛了。%K%P
...It was definitely not because I was getting old or\nanything.%K%P
…这绝对不是上了年纪了，应该吧，\n一个还没过三十的人怎么可以被工作打败！\n我是想这么认为啦。%K%P
But tomorrow would be my first holiday since finding\nemployment. I could sleep until noon with nary a worry\nweighing down on my soul.%K%P
但明天是，再就业以来第一个休息日。\n再稍微加把油，到早上就可以安心睡个懒觉了…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnd there goes another email. Now all that remains...\d%K%P
