%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dM-Ms. Amagi?! But why?!\d%K%P
「天城…小姐？\n怎么会！？」%K%P
The woman who had left for home six hours ago stood there\nlike it was the most natural thing in the world. I almost\nstarted suspecting that the clock in our office was\nbroken.%K%P
让我不禁怀疑刚刚才确认过时钟的指针，\n那玩意儿是不是已经坏掉了，理由就是，\n６个小时前回家的人怎么可能又出现在我的面前啊。%K%P
