%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
She dumped a bag of groceries on the table with a carefree\nmove.%K%P
她随手一扔，便利店的袋子落到桌上。%K%P
A few bottles of tea and a bunch of foodstuffs I suspect\nshe grabbed randomly off the shelves slowly tumbled out of\nit.%K%P
里面散乱地放着塑料瓶的茶，\n和总而言之还算妥善着塞进去的几样食品。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI've got rice balls, sandwiches, curry bread, and\ninarizushi. ...What's your pick?\d%K%P
「饭团、三明治、咖喱面包、炸豆腐寿司…\n你吃哪个？」%K%P
