%LC理
\dA sandwich and curry bread, please.\d%K%P
「请给我三明治和咖喱面包吧」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou really don't like rice, do you?\d%K%P
「…你真的是不爱吃米饭啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's more like... I can't eat it.\d%K%P
「与其说是讨厌…嘛，就是吃不了啊」%K%P
I unwrapped the sandwich and opened up a bottle of tea.%K%P
我毫不客气地打开了三明治的包装，\n同时拧开了红茶的瓶盖。%K%P
It's only been a week, but I felt like I could lower my\nguard around her.%K%P
虽说只有一个礼拜，\n不过我已经感觉到自己能习惯和她坦诚相待了。%K%P
We'd been spending most of our days together, after all.\nBesides, she was just the kind of person that didn't let\nyou get too serious or formal around her.%K%P
嘛，毕竟每天都有大半时间两人独处，\n本来就有种不用顾虑、毫不做作的感觉，感觉很舒爽。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...What?\d%K%P
「…什么？」%K%P
