%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou're welcome...\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
She seemed to be as unperturbed as always as she munched\non a rice ball right in front of my face.%K%P
仿佛理所当然地接受了我毫不客气的行为一般，\n她拿起剩下的饭团，胡乱地拨开包装咬了上去。%K%P
She was one of the very few women I didn't feel\nuncomfortable around.%K%P
她是一位完全不会使我感到无措的，相当少有的女性。%K%P
