%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut sales is definitely not a field you should take\nlightly. I never noticed how hard you had to work until\nnow.\d%K%P
「话说回来，销售这个活儿，果然挺难弄啊。\n虽说至今为止都没怎么注意到」%K%P
In my previous position, I was mostly responsible for\nlistening to the complaints of our sale reps and quelling\ntheir anger...%K%P
到目前为止的工作中，我都是处在被销售人\n各种抱怨和各种呵斥的立场上。%K%P
...but now that our positions had been switched, I fully\nunderstood where they were coming from.%K%P
不过，自己这么一弄，然后再回过头来审视一下的话，\n嘛，反而觉得当时能为那些人多少分担一些烦恼真是太好了。%K%P
Still, they would always make fun of accounting, saying I\nhad it easy just having to play with calculators all day,\nwhich was not true at all. Grasping the hardships of other\nfields was not easy.%K%P
虽说如此，但是总会有人说『你们平时就打打算盘轻轻松松真是好』，\n这话明显能看出，果然还是有不少轻视会计工作的人啊。\n嘛，说白了反正都是彼此彼此互不服气啊。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThank you very much! I guess it's finally time to finish\nup this baby!\d%K%P
「多谢款待！\n好嘞，这下可…」%K%P
