%LC夏夜
\d...When the date changed and I realized the week was\nfinally over, I... I just couldn't endure watching you do\nthis anymore.\d%K%P
「日期已经变更。你首周工作已经结束了。\n…我有点心疼，实在看不下去了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, don't mind me...\d%K%P
「啊，不…」%K%P
Hear no evil, see no evil...%K%P
不要在意，不用在意…%K%P
