%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
And in response to her kind-hearted warning, I chose to\nact as if I had noticed nothing, all so I could think of\nmyself as a proper member of society for just a little\nwhile longer.%K%P
我对那些出于善意的忠告充耳不闻，\n只是出于『要像现在这样做个社会人士』这种自私的愿望，\n用它来做伪装，默默地守护着什么，奢望着什么。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo you could say things are still looking okay... In\nother words, there's a possibility I'll get a few months\nof work and pay, right?\d%K%P
「还是，可以说没问题的…\n就算再过上几个月，我拿到工资的可能性\n还是有的吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d.........Yeah. Things are pretty bad, but it doesn't look\nlike we're completely out of business just yet.\d%K%P
「………嗯。\n虽说是相当微小，要说有的话好像还是有的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThen that's more than enough for me.\d%K%P
「那么，这样就足够了」%K%P
It took a while for that \dyeah\d to come out, and the words\nthat followed were as depressing as they could be, but she\nstill answered in the affirmative.%K%P
无论是『嗯』这一声回答之前的沉默，\n还是之后的答语的内容，\n都是槽点满满的肯定回答。%K%P
And that was all I could hold onto for now.%K%P
现在的我，就算是根稻草也得抓住。\n因为，当我决定要沉浸于要去守护什么的世界里时，\n我的世界里就算没有守护，甚至于满是谎言，我也会刻意逃避。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPlease... Let me dream for just a little while longer.\d%K%P
「拜托你了…\n就再稍微，让我做一阵子梦吧」%K%P
So I could still smile alongside everyone else. So I\nwouldn't need to worry about debts. So I could afford\neating... Italian food.%K%P
心里臆想着欢笑的样子，臆想和大家一起欢笑的样子。\n发自内心的欢笑，驰往的快乐，向往的幸福，\n慢慢地还债，食物…果然还是得吃西餐。%K%P
So I had enough time to find a way for Mitoko to forgive\nme. So that our odd neighbor would give up on her\ninexplicable schemes.%K%P
努力，再努力，让美都子对我的厌恶灰飞烟灭，\n把她那个谜之邻居的野心击个粉碎。%K%P
And so that a certain other person... someone I would\nrather not discuss right now, would...%K%P
然后让另一个人………现在还是先不说了。%K%P
All I wanted was for that dream to last a little while\nlonger.%K%P
这样的时日，我还想再拥有一些…\n不，我还想让这个梦尽量持续下去…将它化作静谧的安眠曲，\n承载脆弱的告慰，剥去狼藉的颓废，一直，不会醒来。%K%P
