Perhaps I really did have nothing to do with her mother in\nthe end.%K%P
美都子母亲的事，\n可能确实和我无关。%K%P
But there was no denying that my presence was at least a\npart of what guided Mitoko to decide to protect this\nboarding house on her own.%K%P
但是，让她一个人下定决心\n要守住这间公寓的背景因素之中，\n我觉得我也多多少少占了一席。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI would've never expected for a case like this to come up\nin our school.\d%K%P
「没想到东萩守地区的学校竟然会有这样的情况」%K%P
Indeed, it was probably not something that happened too\noften in well-off districts like this.%K%P
确实，考虑到这个地区超奢靡的生活质量，\n感觉一般也不会有这种事情的吧。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI suppose the most natural way to approach this would be\nto start looking for her relatives or something.\d%K%P
「要是按一般的方案的话，\n首先要找阳坂同学的亲戚们聚起来谈谈的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMitoko wants to stay here.\d%K%P
「美都子在这是孑然一身」%K%P
